32":"He testifies to what He has seen and heard, yet no one accepts His testimony.","3:33":"Whoever accepts His testimony has certified that God is truthful.","3:34":"For the One whom God has sent speaks the words of God, for God gives the Spirit without limit.","3:35":"The Father loves the Son and has placed all things in His hands.","3:36":"Whoever believes in the Son has eternal life. Whoever rejects the Son will not see life. Instead, the wrath of God remains on him.”"}}},"pairs":{},"minor":[]}